The purpose of this project is for me to practice my ability programming using the following tools:

JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Node.js, NPM, Web Components, Lit, Vite, Git, Bash

There is absolutely no AI generated code of any kind allowed in this project. All AI coding tools are banned.
Also no copying and pasting chunks of code from any external source into this project.

Steps:
1. Set up git for this project, making it a repository.
2. Write the node.js server shell.
3. Write a test for each server endpoint.